OL,3,GNEWSACouncil losing battle against
OL,4,Afly-tipping 'scourge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey council is losing the battle
OL,7,Fagainst fly-tippers despite "doing what
OL,8,Fit can", its scrutiny committee has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FRunnymede Borough Council (RBC) has
OL,12,Fseen illegal dumping increase by more
OL,13,Fthan a third in the last three years,
OL,14,Frising from 1,363 reports in 2023-24 to
OL,15,F1,871 in 2025-26.
OL,17,FThis year has seen 487 reports so far,
OL,18,Fputting it on track to reach 1,948,
OL,19,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,20,FReporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
