OL,3,GNEWSACouncil losing battle against
OL,4,Afly-tipping 'scourge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a meeting held this week, committee
OL,7,Fchair Councillor Shannon Saise-Marshall
OL,8,Furged people to "report, report, report
OL,9,F- because that is the only way we are
OL,10,Fgoing to fix the problem".
